<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Email on knowledge base</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/tags/email/</link><description>Recent content in Email on knowledge base</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><managingEditor>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</managingEditor><webMaster>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2020 03:01:28 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kbs.yinagi.in/tags/email/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Git via Email Getting Started</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/tils/git-via-email-getting-started/</link><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2020 03:01:28 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/tils/git-via-email-getting-started/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Simple way to that is via:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To create a patch: &lt;code&gt;git format-patch &amp;lt;branch-you-want-to-send-patch-to&amp;gt; -o &amp;lt;patches-folder&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A patch file is created, for me it was &lt;code&gt;patches/0001-second.sh.patch&lt;/code&gt;, below is a sample patch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;17
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;18
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;19
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;From d84a8864289616c462827fead5351fb66b86cc3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;From: Sumit Murari &amp;lt;sumit.murari@emailaddr.com&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2020 23:15:12 +0530
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Subject: [PATCH] second.sh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;second.sh | 1 +
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;create mode 100644 second.sh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;diff --git a/second.sh b/second.sh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;new file mode 100644
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;index 0000000..e019be0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;--- /dev/null
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;+++ b/second.sh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;@@ -0,0 +1 @@
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;+second
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;--
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;2.24.0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To apply a patch: &lt;code&gt;git am&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;am&lt;/code&gt; is for apply mailbox or &lt;strong&gt;Apply a series of patches from a mailbox&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;References: &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QtXj9tt-RUE"&gt;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QtXj9tt-RUE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Please Use Plain Text for Email</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/please-use-plain-text-for-email/</link><pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2020 06:17:03 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/please-use-plain-text-for-email/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>